# Docker build context for the two images in ./Dockerfile (targets "api" and "planner").
# Allowlist: everything is excluded, then only what the images COPY is re-included. Recorded routing inputs are
# never taken from the build context: the API image downloads and SHA-256-verifies them (tools/fetch_routing_inputs.py).
*

# Route-Check API image
!constraints-routing.txt
!api/
!integration/
!contracts/
!docs/RELEASE_IDENTITY.json
!research/routing/
!tools/fetch_routing_inputs.py
!tests/__init__.py
!tests/api/
!scripts/api_smoke.sh
!docs/solve2027/reproduce/

# Planner image (static build; tests/planner is type-checked by `npm run build`)
!planner/
!tests/planner/

# Never part of an image: local environments, caches, builds, secrets and planner working folders
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
**/.pytest_cache
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
integration/build
planner/node_modules
planner/dist
planner/.assets
planner/.test-cache
planner/cache/.state
planner/exports
planner/test-results
planner/playwright-report
planner/research-map
planner/docs
planner/mock_api
